## Development

Install Rust through rustup, just, and actionlint. The Rust toolchain and MSRV
are pinned to {{ vars.rust_version }}. Run `cargo fetch --locked` before the
offline checks.

```sh
just skills-sync
cargo fetch --locked
just check
```

Read [contributing](CONTRIBUTING.md) and [agent instructions](AGENTS.md) before
working. See [security reporting](SECURITY.md) to report a vulnerability.

